4750 The RealWorld app's ownership report. `dump --stage=ownership` re-checks every core module from source (`no_pack`, ownership-checker.md §16.9), so its cost grows with `core/Schema`. Measured 4 248M on master 89e49b518 (98.8% of the gates' budget), then 4 317M with derived codecs (#206), whose library engine adds ~400 lines to `core/Schema`; a `check` of the same program reads the checked core and moved +6M. This grant adds 10% to 4 317M. Remove it when the ownership dump installs the checked core's summaries rather than re-checking core (issue #214).
